      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this little scratch on my arm like 2 days ago from my cat and it was fine but now there is this thin red line coming from the cut and going up my arm towards my elbow. i also feel kind of shivery/chilly. should i just put more neosporin on it or is this something bad?",
