      "content": "wait really? it doesn't look that bad though, just a tiny line. and i'm kinda broke right now so urgent care is like a hundred bucks minimum. can't i just take some extra ibuprofen and keep the ointment on it for another day to see if the redness goes away? i dont want to go to the doctor if it's just a small thing.",
