    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you. honestly i'm just really scared to go if it's not actually a huge deal. my cousin has a bottle of amoxicillin from a previous thing he had, do you think i could just take a couple of those to see if it kills the infection? i really just want to avoid the clinic if i can just get ahead of it with some actual medicine at home.",
