      "content": "Do not use your cousin's antibiotics or take any prescription medication without a doctor's explicit diagnosis and dosage recommendation, as Cat Scratch Disease requires specific treatment timing that is difficult to prevent if started incorrectly. Self-medicating can mask symptoms, lead to antibiotic resistance, or completely miss the window for effective treatment, potentially turning a minor issue into a serious infection. Please prioritize your safety and get checked by a healthcare professional today even if the symptoms seem small now.",
